<title>USA: Castle Energy raises stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Castle Energy raises stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Castle Energy Corp said Tuesday its increased its share repurchase authorization by one million shares to up to 2.5 million shares.</p>
<p>To date, 1,470,000 shares have been repurchased under the program.  Any additional shares will be bought back over the next year in the open market, the company said.  </p>
<p>The share price of the oil and gas company rose 1/8 to 13-1/2, after touching a new year high of 14-1/8 in earlier trading.</p>
<p>Castle Energy had roughly 5.8 million shares outstanding at the end of its second quarter ended March 31.</p>
